WEBVTT

00:14:22.926 --> 00:14:31.911
Dakle - tri verzije. (Aplauz).
Oh. (Smeh)

00:14:31.911 --> 00:14:34.892
(Aplauz) Tri verzije fizičkog
razmišljanja, da?

00:14:34.892 --> 00:14:37.851
Tri verzije fizičkog razmišljanja.
Nadam se da ćete danas

00:14:37.851 --> 00:14:39.425
kad odete izmisliti ples

00:14:39.425 --> 00:14:41.378
za sebe, a ako ne to

00:14:41.378 --> 00:14:43.605
bar se prelepo nedolično
ponašajte, što češće.

00:14:43.605 --> 00:14:46.223
Mnogo vam hvala.
(Aplauz)

00:14:46.223 --> 00:14:50.953
Hvala. Hvala.
(Aplauz)

00:14:50.953 --> 00:14:53.264
Idemo.
(Aplauz)

00:14:53.264 --> 00:14:57.260
(Aplauz)